{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is your gateway into the world of <i>Emery Hearts</i>, an action RPG with voxel aesthetics and retro inspiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you\u2019ll be able to experience the core mechanics and witness the beginning of the story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Exploration</strong>: venture into voxel-crafted areas full of details and hidden corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Real-time combat</strong>: face mechanical enemies with a fast and dynamic system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles</strong>: use environmental elements to overcome clever challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>First steps of the story</strong>: discover the beginning of Lug\u2019s journey on a planet where humans and machines struggle to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is just a taste of the full game planned for 2026, but enough to let you feel its essence and share your feedback with us.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942570?t=1759834536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942570?t=1759834536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942570/a13c9785ddb100e3ea5d5d170005f803c8117f3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759834536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942570/a13c9785ddb100e3ea5d5d170005f803c8117f3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759834536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descripti